`,kse=`// --- vendored for self-containment (2026-06-07) ---------------------
// origin   standard
// source   data/standards/components/N2.dat
// sha256   1d6d927c975adbd592a4bdd9621ea023e4d4364856c383e4eec755e07e4d02d3
