`,T8e=`// --- vendored for self-containment (2026-06-07) ---------------------
// origin   standard
// source   data/standards/components/benzene.dat
// sha256   d5fc6187fa89257f3f0333b5f39273f43755499ff1010dc9eb06ef1124030828
// note     byte-copy of the FROZEN reference at vendoring time. This case
