`,wHe="",CHe=`/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\\
  cstr07_lhhw_methylAcetate  --  a HETEROGENEOUSLY catalysed esterification with
  a Langmuir-Hinshelwood-Hougen-Watson rate law, on activities.
\\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

